-- title:
--   Determinant table of the lift-trace seed equals χ₋₃ of the norm
-- statement:
--   Let $L$ be a number field, Galois over $\mathbb{Q}$, and let $e$ be a group isomorphism from $\mathrm{Gal}(L/\mathbb{Q})$ onto $\mathrm{GL}_2(\mathbb{Z}/3)$; let $H$ be an arbitrary subgroup of $\mathrm{Gal}(L/\mathbb{Q})$, and write $K$ for the intermediate field `FixedPoints.intermediateField H` of $L/\mathbb{Q}$. Assume `DetDictionaryRow e`: for every prime $\ell \neq 3$ and every prime ideal $Q$ of $\mathcal{O}_L$ lying over $\ell\mathbb{Z}$ with finite residue ring and with trivial inertia subgroup in $\mathrm{Gal}(L/\mathbb{Q})$, the matrix $e(\mathrm{arithFrobAt}\,Q)$ has determinant $\ell \bmod 3$. Then there is a finite set $S$ of height-one primes of $\mathcal{O}_K$ such that for every height-one prime $v \notin S$ the $b$-entry at $v$ of the Hecke eigensystem `P2.liftTraceSeed e H` equals the image in $\mathbb{Z}[\sqrt{-2}]$ of $\chi_{-3}(N v)$, where $N v$ is the absolute norm of $v$ and $\chi_{-3}(n)$ is $1$, $-1$ or $0$ according as $n \equiv 1, 2, 0 \bmod 3$. Here that $b$-entry is by definition the determinant of `liftOf (e (seedFrob H v))`, the chosen matrix over $\mathbb{Z}[\sqrt{-2}]$ lying in the submonoid generated by `Slift` and `Tlift` and reducing, under `red`, to $e$ of the arithmetic Frobenius at a prime of $L$ over $v$ raised to its relative degree for $H$.
--
--   This is the determinant (central character) row of the dictionary between the lift-trace Hecke data attached to a $\mathrm{GL}_2(\mathbb{F}_3)$-field and the Eisenstein character $\chi_{-3}$: the determinant of every element of the lifted monoid is a sign, and modulo $3$ that sign is the norm of $v$. It feeds the identification of `P2.liftTraceSeed` with automorphic data in [`LanglandsTunnell.exists_liftValued_of_agreesLiftTraceSeed_isCusp_pair`](thm.html#LanglandsTunnell.exists_liftValued_of_agreesLiftTraceSeed_isCusp_pair) and in the two quadratic ray-class character tables for the quaternionic and Sylow choices of $H$.
-- source:
--   https://github.com/anthropics/fermats-last-theorem/blob/aa2d8b34692b16c70f699536de0d8e75b9a3e9ef/Theorems/Thm_LanglandsTunnell_liftTraceSeed_b_eq_chiNegThree_of_detDictionaryRow.lean

import Definitions.Def_LanglandsTunnell_LiftTraceSeed
